me":"Arrangement #710 - Master Render.ogg","source":"derivative","format":"Ogg Vorbis","original":"Arrangement #710 - Master Render.wav","mtime":"1541335976","size":"18199854","md5":"be0b6ee5df769b61a94aa7c7c71622f8","crc32":"1f1708f5","sha1":"34d848987910aa410f15874064d75c95d03fe2d5","length":"1680","height":"0","width":"0"},{"name":"Arrangement #710 - Master Render.png","source":"derivative","format":"PNG","original":"Arrangement #710 - Master Render.wav","mtime":"1541336028","size":"11737","md5":"7ad2eeba12b7aa45dd9a848b61f5b2ed","crc32":"4415bb8b","sha1":"5824d1be831b468b72ea51ecd077858c71ab2105"},{"name":"Arrangement #710 - Master Render.wav","source":"original","mtime":"1541335800","size":"444528044","md5":"2fb16358ff3178bd761f623219b6c749","crc32":"141018f2","sha1":"82caf311766b9c9be7c562a0181ccb66eefc8341","format":"WAVE","length":"1680","height":"0","width":"0","track":"01"},{"name":"Arrangement #710 - Master Render_spectrogram.png","source":"derivative","format":"Spectrogram","original":"Arrangement #710 - Master Render.wav","mtime":"1541336034","size":"323886","md5":"a96bba3a3efa46d05f146e99cdb858b3","crc32":"beb9fe47","sha1":"0fb82d90e590cb0435a6e49ba82bc0c3146c2378"},{"name":"__ia_thumb.jpg","source":"original","mtime":"1623872896","size":"13360","format":"Item Tile","rotation":"0","md5":"37fd6a5d53acdc811820dfca37f7b75c","crc32":"ab8377d5","sha1":"0ff8dc0521fa3202699f0f4d8e2cf343ac92c524"},{"name":"history/files/Collection_Header.png.~1~","source":"original","mtime":"1541335816","size":"10809","md5":"b7d069a6c5faca9517548121b5dcf197","crc32":"5289cb91","sha1":"9426912d2f32f9e99e57dd6e2022bbf4c37dad2d","format":"Unknown","old_version":"true"},{"name":"radia_no710_zufall_w1.jpg","source":"original","mtime":"1551789423","size":"2481639","md5":"5c394798c047177d8378f4d963e70f5b","crc32":"95b639ac","sha1":"427415a95d658bf2aa7fccdc34f098667ead013a","format":"JPEG","rotation":"0"},{"name":"radia_no710_zufall_w1_thumb.jpg","source":"derivative","format":"JPEG Thumb","original":"radia_no710_zufall_w1.jpg","mtime":"1551789461","size":"4960","md5":"3ea573fba416029c00860d788f1811d5","crc32":"b7fb569d","sha1":"2068dae986166e2c9f9c34f04fd26c915fc04896"}],"files_count":15,"item_last_updated":1711504523,"item_size":767644760,"metadata":{"identifier":"710_zufall_randomness","mediatype":"audio","collection":["radiafm","radioprograms","radiostationarchives"],"creator":"Orange 94.0","date":"2018-11-05","description":"<p style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, 'Bitstream Charter', serif;font-size:13.8px;\">Zufall, zufällig, Zufallsgenerator, zufallen, to fall, accidens, accidere – from latin: ad ‘to’ and cadere ‘to fall’ – in german a calque, in english taken directly from the latin word and therefore accidentially.</p><p style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, 'Bitstream Charter', serif;font-size:13.8px;\">To form a radioshow around the topic needed more than an accidentially arranging of accidentially recorded files.</p><p style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, 'Bitstream Charter', serif;font-size:13.8px;\">Serendipity revolves around the “glückliche Zufall”. With a little help from the word “Zufall” the German languages is providing a whole space with a single incident. The differentiation is neither precise nor clear. Our world in patterns and algorithms produces a fear of randomness and uncertainty. Hence the “Zufall”-itself suddenly turns into a protected species. This poetic road-feature is an attempt to search for the “Zufall” and find:</p><pre style=\"background:rgb(247,247,247);border:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:24px;padding:1.5em;vertical-align:baseline;font-family:'Courier 10 Pitch', Courier, monospace;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:21px;font-size:15px;\">accident der Zufall Pl.: die Zufälle \nchance der Zufall Pl.: die Zufälle \nhazard der Zufall Pl.: die Zufälle \nluck der Zufall Pl.: die Zufälle \ncoincidence der Zufall Pl.: die Zufälle \nhappenstance der Zufall Pl.: die Zufälle \nfortuitousness der Zufall Pl.: die Zufälle \nfortuity der Zufall Pl.: die Zufälle \nfortune der Zufall Pl.: die Zufälle \nconcurrence der Zufall Pl.: die Zufälle \nhap der Zufall Pl.: die Zufälle \ncontingency der Zufall Pl.: die Zufälle \nfluke [ugs.] der Zufall Pl.: die Zufälle\n\nlucky break glücklicher Zufall \nserendipity glücklicher Zufall \ncontretemps unglücklicher Zufall \nfluke [ugs.] glücklicher Zufall \nfortunate coincidence glücklicher Zufall</pre><p style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, 'Bitstream Charter', serif;font-size:13.8px;\">We didn’t only acoustically look for it but constructed frameworks around our “Zufall”. Created beds for it, went on a journey, set up surveillance micros for ourselves and started with a meeting without a meeting-point. We welcomed the “Zufall” back to our hyper-controlled lives, created to protect us from disappointment and frustration but creating a series of frustrating reciprocal effects.</p><p style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, 'Bitstream Charter', serif;font-size:13.8px;\"><strong style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\">Contributors:<br /></strong>Maria Herold<br />b#<br />Barbara Kaiser<br />Lale Rodgarkia-Dara<br />Karl H. Schönswetter<br />Peter Wetzelsberger</p><p style=\"background:rgb(255,255,255);border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Georgia, 'Bitstream Charter', serif;font-size:13.8px;\"><strong style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;\">Thanks to:</strong><br />Maria Sulzer & Family<br />Majo<br />Nikola<br />Manuel Waldner</p>","language":"ger","licenseurl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/","radiaseason":"41","scanner":"Internet Archive HTML5 Uploader 1.6.3","subject":"radio art;Radia;Orange 94.0","title":"Show 0710: Zufall (Randomness) by Wiener Radia Kollektiv (Orange 94.0)","publicdate":"2018-11-04 12:50:00","uploader":"radia.fm@gmail.com","addeddate":"2018-11-04 12:50:00","backup_location":"ia906803_27"},"server":"ia800201.us.archive.org","uniq":697045099,"workable_servers":["ia800201.us.archive.org","ia600201.us.archive.org"]}